[[:db/add "f996046c-a5c8-5720-b5e3-35170c7906ae" :answer/id #uuid "f996046c-a5c8-5720-b5e3-35170c7906ae"] [:db/add "f996046c-a5c8-5720-b5e3-35170c7906ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f996046c-a5c8-5720-b5e3-35170c7906ae" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{3 x}{2}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- \\frac{3 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "f996046c-a5c8-5720-b5e3-35170c7906ae" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ec3dff48-bdbc-5185-83e9-3143d4a0ffcb" :answer/id #uuid "ec3dff48-bdbc-5185-83e9-3143d4a0ffcb"] [:db/add "ec3dff48-bdbc-5185-83e9-3143d4a0ffcb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ec3dff48-bdbc-5185-83e9-3143d4a0ffcb" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{7 x}{2}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- \\frac{7 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "ec3dff48-bdbc-5185-83e9-3143d4a0ffcb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5125e6f5-42dc-5d2b-ac35-771aef6e14de" :answer/id #uuid "5125e6f5-42dc-5d2b-ac35-771aef6e14de"] [:db/add "5125e6f5-42dc-5d2b-ac35-771aef6e14de" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5125e6f5-42dc-5d2b-ac35-771aef6e14de" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{4 x}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{4 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "5125e6f5-42dc-5d2b-ac35-771aef6e14de" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2cdbbe3c-eec3-59a6-b054-5cec462a5469" :answer/id #uuid "2cdbbe3c-eec3-59a6-b054-5cec462a5469"] [:db/add "2cdbbe3c-eec3-59a6-b054-5cec462a5469" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2cdbbe3c-eec3-59a6-b054-5cec462a5469" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "2cdbbe3c-eec3-59a6-b054-5cec462a5469" :answer/validate] [:db/add "41263caa-37d4-5894-bdd4-055b030643a5" :answer/id #uuid "41263caa-37d4-5894-bdd4-055b030643a5"] [:db/add "41263caa-37d4-5894-bdd4-055b030643a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "41263caa-37d4-5894-bdd4-055b030643a5" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{2 x}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{2 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "41263caa-37d4-5894-bdd4-055b030643a5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "73c95eb2-c30a-586d-8c98-83cb726f1e9a" :answer-field/id #uuid "73c95eb2-c30a-586d-8c98-83cb726f1e9a"] [:db/add "73c95eb2-c30a-586d-8c98-83cb726f1e9a" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "73c95eb2-c30a-586d-8c98-83cb726f1e9a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "73c95eb2-c30a-586d-8c98-83cb726f1e9a" :answer-field/choices "f996046c-a5c8-5720-b5e3-35170c7906ae"] [:db/add "73c95eb2-c30a-586d-8c98-83cb726f1e9a" :answer-field/choices "ec3dff48-bdbc-5185-83e9-3143d4a0ffcb"] [:db/add "73c95eb2-c30a-586d-8c98-83cb726f1e9a" :answer-field/choices "5125e6f5-42dc-5d2b-ac35-771aef6e14de"] [:db/add "73c95eb2-c30a-586d-8c98-83cb726f1e9a" :answer-field/choices "2cdbbe3c-eec3-59a6-b054-5cec462a5469"] [:db/add "73c95eb2-c30a-586d-8c98-83cb726f1e9a" :answer-field/choices "41263caa-37d4-5894-bdd4-055b030643a5"] [:db/add "73c95eb2-c30a-586d-8c98-83cb726f1e9a" :answer-field/correct "2cdbbe3c-eec3-59a6-b054-5cec462a5469"] [:db/ensure "73c95eb2-c30a-586d-8c98-83cb726f1e9a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "03037866-9e99-5a94-acdf-a5e7b89db4df" :question/id #uuid "03037866-9e99-5a94-acdf-a5e7b89db4df"] [:db/add "03037866-9e99-5a94-acdf-a5e7b89db4df" :question/problem "Consider the following first-order linear ODE for the function $y = y(x)$:\n$\\frac{dy}{dx}+\\left(\\frac{10}{3}\\right)\\cdot y=\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}$\nWrite the equation in the form $\\frac{d}{dx}(yI(x)) = I(x)Q(x)$, where $I(x)$ is an integrating factor."] [:db/add "03037866-9e99-5a94-acdf-a5e7b89db4df" :question/worked-solution "This equation is in the standard form\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}+P(x)y=Q(x)\n$$\n\nwith $P(x)=\\frac{10}{3}$ and $Q(x)=\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}.$ We proceed to find an integrating factor $I(x)$ using the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x) & =e^{\\int P(x)\\,dx} \\\\  & =e^{\\int \\left(\\frac{10}{3}\\right)\\,dx} \\\\  & =e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply our differential equation through by $I(x)=e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}+\\left(\\frac{10}{3}\\right)\\cdot y\\right) & =\\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right) \\\\ \\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{dy}{dx}+\\left(\\frac{10}{3}\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot y & =\\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we rewrite the left hand side as $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(y\\cdot I(x)):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\right) & =\\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "03037866-9e99-5a94-acdf-a5e7b89db4df" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "03037866-9e99-5a94-acdf-a5e7b89db4df" :question/answer-fields "73c95eb2-c30a-586d-8c98-83cb726f1e9a"] [:db/ensure "03037866-9e99-5a94-acdf-a5e7b89db4df" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087877 :knowledge-point/questions "03037866-9e99-5a94-acdf-a5e7b89db4df"] [:db/add "5715b197-fea3-5795-a30f-eca5473766a5" :answer/id #uuid "5715b197-fea3-5795-a30f-eca5473766a5"] [:db/add "5715b197-fea3-5795-a30f-eca5473766a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5715b197-fea3-5795-a30f-eca5473766a5" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- \\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(x\\right)"] [:db/ensure "5715b197-fea3-5795-a30f-eca5473766a5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5eebc27c-cc1e-5d1d-8990-81b437046835" :answer/id #uuid "5eebc27c-cc1e-5d1d-8990-81b437046835"] [:db/add "5eebc27c-cc1e-5d1d-8990-81b437046835" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5eebc27c-cc1e-5d1d-8990-81b437046835" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- 4 x}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- 4 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(x\\right)"] [:db/ensure "5eebc27c-cc1e-5d1d-8990-81b437046835" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8dfe767a-bded-5152-80e4-58685e889a3a" :answer/id #uuid "8dfe767a-bded-5152-80e4-58685e889a3a"] [:db/add "8dfe767a-bded-5152-80e4-58685e889a3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8dfe767a-bded-5152-80e4-58685e889a3a" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{\\frac{11 x}{3}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{\\frac{11 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(x\\right)"] [:db/ensure "8dfe767a-bded-5152-80e4-58685e889a3a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "49b9dacc-5eb7-5601-a991-c899cddfdc1d" :answer/id #uuid "49b9dacc-5eb7-5601-a991-c899cddfdc1d"] [:db/add "49b9dacc-5eb7-5601-a991-c899cddfdc1d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "49b9dacc-5eb7-5601-a991-c899cddfdc1d" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(x\\right)"] [:db/ensure "49b9dacc-5eb7-5601-a991-c899cddfdc1d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "970cbe8b-8d43-55ff-96af-cf74e39c9fa2" :answer/id #uuid "970cbe8b-8d43-55ff-96af-cf74e39c9fa2"] [:db/add "970cbe8b-8d43-55ff-96af-cf74e39c9fa2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "970cbe8b-8d43-55ff-96af-cf74e39c9fa2" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{x}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(x\\right)"] [:db/ensure "970cbe8b-8d43-55ff-96af-cf74e39c9fa2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "65396b0d-596d-5a6b-b4ce-8766a7d89e23" :answer-field/id #uuid "65396b0d-596d-5a6b-b4ce-8766a7d89e23"] [:db/add "65396b0d-596d-5a6b-b4ce-8766a7d89e23" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "65396b0d-596d-5a6b-b4ce-8766a7d89e23" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "65396b0d-596d-5a6b-b4ce-8766a7d89e23" :answer-field/choices "5715b197-fea3-5795-a30f-eca5473766a5"] [:db/add "65396b0d-596d-5a6b-b4ce-8766a7d89e23" :answer-field/choices "5eebc27c-cc1e-5d1d-8990-81b437046835"] [:db/add "65396b0d-596d-5a6b-b4ce-8766a7d89e23" :answer-field/choices "8dfe767a-bded-5152-80e4-58685e889a3a"] [:db/add "65396b0d-596d-5a6b-b4ce-8766a7d89e23" :answer-field/choices "49b9dacc-5eb7-5601-a991-c899cddfdc1d"] [:db/add "65396b0d-596d-5a6b-b4ce-8766a7d89e23" :answer-field/choices "970cbe8b-8d43-55ff-96af-cf74e39c9fa2"] [:db/add "65396b0d-596d-5a6b-b4ce-8766a7d89e23" :answer-field/correct "49b9dacc-5eb7-5601-a991-c899cddfdc1d"] [:db/ensure "65396b0d-596d-5a6b-b4ce-8766a7d89e23" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1c8efe23-e1fe-5151-83ef-1ed23bccc20c" :question/id #uuid "1c8efe23-e1fe-5151-83ef-1ed23bccc20c"] [:db/add "1c8efe23-e1fe-5151-83ef-1ed23bccc20c" :question/problem "Consider the following first-order linear ODE for the function $y=y(x):$\n\n$$\n\\left(x\\right)\\cdot \\frac{dy}{dx}-\\left(x\\right)\\cdot y=x^{2}\n$$\n\nWrite the equation in the form $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(yI(x))=I(x)Q(x),$ where $I(x)$ is an integrating factor.\n\nAssume $x>0$."] [:db/add "1c8efe23-e1fe-5151-83ef-1ed23bccc20c" :question/worked-solution "First, we write the equation in standard form. This gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}-y=x.\n$$\n\nThis equation is in the standard form\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}+P(x)y=Q(x)\n$$\n\nwith $P(x)=-1$ and $Q(x)=x.$ We proceed to find an integrating factor $I(x)$ using the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x) & =e^{\\int P(x)\\,dx} \\\\  & =e^{\\int \\left(-1\\right)\\,dx} \\\\  & =e^{- x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply our differential equation through by $I(x)=e^{- x}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}-y\\right) & =\\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(x\\right) \\\\ \\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{dy}{dx}-\\left(1\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\cdot y & =\\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(x\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we rewrite the left hand side as $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(y\\cdot I(x)):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\right) & =\\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(x\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "1c8efe23-e1fe-5151-83ef-1ed23bccc20c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "1c8efe23-e1fe-5151-83ef-1ed23bccc20c" :question/answer-fields "65396b0d-596d-5a6b-b4ce-8766a7d89e23"] [:db/ensure "1c8efe23-e1fe-5151-83ef-1ed23bccc20c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087877 :knowledge-point/questions "1c8efe23-e1fe-5151-83ef-1ed23bccc20c"] [:db/add "5849bb21-c3c8-5362-8214-bedc3448cb5e" :answer/id #uuid "5849bb21-c3c8-5362-8214-bedc3448cb5e"] [:db/add "5849bb21-c3c8-5362-8214-bedc3448cb5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5849bb21-c3c8-5362-8214-bedc3448cb5e" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{3}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(- 4 e^{- x}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "5849bb21-c3c8-5362-8214-bedc3448cb5e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6bd99f05-2c47-53ab-9a18-e401392146dd" :answer/id #uuid "6bd99f05-2c47-53ab-9a18-e401392146dd"] [:db/add "6bd99f05-2c47-53ab-9a18-e401392146dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6bd99f05-2c47-53ab-9a18-e401392146dd" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{\\frac{5 x}{3}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{\\frac{5 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(- 4 e^{- x}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "6bd99f05-2c47-53ab-9a18-e401392146dd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "04bd9421-b85f-5ced-83ce-bd91ecae0cce" :answer/id #uuid "04bd9421-b85f-5ced-83ce-bd91ecae0cce"] [:db/add "04bd9421-b85f-5ced-83ce-bd91ecae0cce" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "04bd9421-b85f-5ced-83ce-bd91ecae0cce" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(- 4 e^{- x}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "04bd9421-b85f-5ced-83ce-bd91ecae0cce" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c111530e-6e5e-5007-8585-f014984545d1" :answer/id #uuid "c111530e-6e