problem "Consider the following first-order linear ODE for the function $y=y(x):$\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}-\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)\\cdot y=- 4 e^{- x}\n$$\n\nWrite the equation in the form $\\frac{d}{dx}(yI(x))=I(x)Q(x),$ where $I(x)$ is an integrating factor."] [:db/add "42c0edeb-b8c7-5cb6-92b5-b5c442e78493" :question/worked-solution "This equation is in the standard form\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}+P(x)y=Q(x)\n$$\n\nwith $P(x)=- \\frac{5}{2}$ and $Q(x)=- 4 e^{- x}.$ We proceed to find an integrating factor $I(x)$ using the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x) & =e^{\\int P(x)\\,dx} \\\\  & =e^{\\int \\left(- \\frac{5}{2}\\right)\\,dx} \\\\  & =e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply our differential equation through by $I(x)=e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}-\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)\\cdot y\\right) & =\\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(- 4 e^{- x}\\right) \\\\ \\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{dy}{dx}-\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot y & =\\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(- 4 e^{- x}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we rewrite the left hand side as $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(y\\cdot I(x)):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\right) & =\\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(- 4 e^{- x}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "42c0edeb-b8c7-5cb6-92b5-b5c442e78493" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "42c0edeb-b8c7-5cb6-92b5-b5c442e78493" :question/answer-fields "0da46da2-fb19-59ab-9e0a-1eeedbd2f6d0"] [:db/ensure "42c0edeb-b8c7-5cb6-92b5-b5c442e78493" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087877 :knowledge-point/questions "42c0edeb-b8c7-5cb6-92b5-b5c442e78493"] [:db/add "149a4b2e-3fbe-5e93-835e-fa11562b9a72" :answer/id #uuid "149a4b2e-3fbe-5e93-835e-fa11562b9a72"] [:db/add "149a4b2e-3fbe-5e93-835e-fa11562b9a72" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "149a4b2e-3fbe-5e93-835e-fa11562b9a72" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "149a4b2e-3fbe-5e93-835e-fa11562b9a72" :answer/validate] [:db/add "47c71a09-eb51-5016-8a2d-b7f286957a04" :answer/id #uuid "47c71a09-eb51-5016-8a2d-b7f286957a04"] [:db/add "47c71a09-eb51-5016-8a2d-b7f286957a04" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "47c71a09-eb51-5016-8a2d-b7f286957a04" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{\\frac{11 x}{3}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{\\frac{11 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "47c71a09-eb51-5016-8a2d-b7f286957a04" :answer/validate] [:db/add "03e46a24-4c00-5189-98d7-bfa6a2a5cc41" :answer/id #uuid "03e46a24-4c00-5189-98d7-bfa6a2a5cc41"] [:db/add "03e46a24-4c00-5189-98d7-bfa6a2a5cc41" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "03e46a24-4c00-5189-98d7-bfa6a2a5cc41" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{3 x}{2}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- \\frac{3 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "03e46a24-4c00-5189-98d7-bfa6a2a5cc41" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e77f6ee4-c86c-5466-bba9-ae18e96875b6" :answer/id #uuid "e77f6ee4-c86c-5466-bba9-ae18e96875b6"] [:db/add "e77f6ee4-c86c-5466-bba9-ae18e96875b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e77f6ee4-c86c-5466-bba9-ae18e96875b6" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{3 x}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{3 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "e77f6ee4-c86c-5466-bba9-ae18e96875b6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "eb9a849b-b505-51e2-9d27-afd52c0e2f89" :answer/id #uuid "eb9a849b-b505-51e2-9d27-afd52c0e2f89"] [:db/add "eb9a849b-b505-51e2-9d27-afd52c0e2f89" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "eb9a849b-b505-51e2-9d27-afd52c0e2f89" :answer/value "\\frac{d}{