" :answer-field/choices "37fd9fa0-313a-5948-869a-7bb48ef556ca"] [:db/add "6b0e36f2-815e-54a1-8afb-76e8a3006d96" :answer-field/choices "e7687e49-de61-5573-82a3-54c8c24dacef"] [:db/add "6b0e36f2-815e-54a1-8afb-76e8a3006d96" :answer-field/choices "72a10986-6814-5106-93f8-07b882b726b2"] [:db/add "6b0e36f2-815e-54a1-8afb-76e8a3006d96" :answer-field/choices "288156d7-fbae-55ec-bd81-8d26b011bb58"] [:db/add "6b0e36f2-815e-54a1-8afb-76e8a3006d96" :answer-field/correct "efbc24a7-fe90-5c36-873d-4a7845114573"] [:db/ensure "6b0e36f2-815e-54a1-8afb-76e8a3006d96" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "9942a33c-ad0a-505a-b3a0-6cc7077c009b" :question/id #uuid "9942a33c-ad0a-505a-b3a0-6cc7077c009b"] [:db/add "9942a33c-ad0a-505a-b3a0-6cc7077c009b" :question/problem "Consider the following first-order linear ODE for the function $y=y(x):$\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}-\\left(3\\right)\\cdot y=e^{3 x}\n$$\n\nWrite the equation in the form $\\frac{d}{dx}(yI(x))=I(x)Q(x),$ where $I(x)$ is an integrating factor."] [:db/add "9942a33c-ad0a-505a-b3a0-6cc7077c009b" :question/worked-solution "This equation is in the standard form\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}+P(x)y=Q(x)\n$$\n\nwith $P(x)=-3$ and $Q(x)=e^{3 x}.$ We proceed to find an integrating factor $I(x)$ using the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x) & =e^{\\int P(x)\\,dx} \\\\  & =e^{\\int \\left(-3\\right)\\,dx} \\\\  & =e^{- 3 x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply our differential equation through by $I(x)=e^{- 3 x}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left(e^{- 3 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}-\\left(3\\right)\\cdot y\\right) & =\\left(e^{- 3 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{3 x}\\right) \\\\ \\left(e^{- 3 x}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{dy}{dx}-\\left(3\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{- 3 x}\\right)\\cdot y & =\\left(e^{- 3 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{3 x}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we rewrite the left hand side as $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(y\\cdot I(x)):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- 3 x}\\right)\\right) & =\\left(e^{- 3 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{3 x}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "9942a33c-ad0a-505a-b3a0-6cc7077c009b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "9942a33c-ad0a-505a-b3a0-6cc7077c009b" :question/answer-fields "6b0e36f2-815e-54a1-8afb-76e8a3006d96"] [:db/ensure "9942a33c-ad0a-505a-b3a0-6cc7077c009b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087877 :knowledge-point/questions "9942a33c-ad0a-505a-b3a0-6cc7077c009b"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "228d5506-2e3a-56f7-bc01-c98ccc5be1b2"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/ee/eea3f8538b272de250a2e28d761324fbbddfee3306cabf02acddd557568b8a40/17592186087877.py"] [:db/add 17592186087877 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186087877 :knowledge-point/validate]]
